      <div type="clause" n="1.9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 1.9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf seo lad forðcume, beo he ðes weres wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he succeeds in clearing himself, he shall be entitled to the wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif seo lad forðcume, beo he þæs weres wurðe.</ab>
